				\begin{document}$$R^2$$\end{document}, root mean square error (RMSE), and p-value–were recorded. Ninety-five percent confidence intervals were computed for R where applicable.
External Validation. After cross-validation, each model was retrained on the full training set and evaluated on the untouched 20% external test set. The same metrics (R, \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
