				\begin{document}$$R^2$$\end{document}, RMSE, p-value) were computed to assess predictive performance on unseen data.This pipeline–combining VIF filtering, strict train–test splitting, scaling within folds, and reporting both cross-validation and external test metrics–was applied to all nine physicochemical properties. It provides strong control against overfitting and ensures that the reported statistics reflect genuine predictive performance.

Despite these drawbacks, mitoxantrone’s clinical effectiveness43, distinct method of action, and use as a model chemical for research on DNA-intercalating compounds45 make it an essential anticancer agent. Researchers are investigating combination treatments50, nanoparticle-based delivery, and structural changes to create new analogs with enhanced efficacy and decreased toxicity44 in order to get around its drawbacks. There is no denying the relevance of mitoxantrone in the treatment of cancer, and current research attempts to maximize its therapeutic potential while reducing its side effects. Mitoxantrone’s unit (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
